WEBVTT

01:30.940 --> 01:34.979
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.050 --> 01:38.000
[Episode 25]

01:39.000 --> 01:40.060
Please have a seat.

01:42.640 --> 01:43.789
Let me.

01:49.590 --> 01:50.789
Have a taste, Lord Gu.

01:50.920 --> 01:52.229
This is what they usually drink.

01:52.229 --> 01:53.560
It's similar to our tea.

02:03.120 --> 02:04.120
How do you like it?

02:09.280 --> 02:10.190
Similar?

02:10.590 --> 02:11.570
Not at all.

02:13.190 --> 02:14.590
The British don't drink tea?

02:14.590 --> 02:15.320
They do.

02:15.400 --> 02:16.730
They just add milk to it.

02:19.800 --> 02:20.329
Captain.

02:25.360 --> 02:26.290
Greetings, sir.

02:27.400 --> 02:28.930
It's a pleasure to meet you.

02:29.800 --> 02:30.910
A handshake will do.

02:30.910 --> 02:32.840
He said it's a pleasure to meet you.

02:33.310 --> 02:33.970
How are you?

02:34.030 --> 02:34.690
How are you?

02:35.560 --> 02:36.150
I'm fine.

02:36.960 --> 02:37.620
He's great.

02:37.950 --> 02:41.450
[Tod, British Warship Captain]

02:41.400 --> 02:42.310
The captain says

02:42.310 --> 02:43.560
this warship belongs to

02:43.560 --> 02:45.340
the British Empire's Indian Navy,

02:45.340 --> 02:47.400
protecting the Indian Ocean routes.

02:49.470 --> 02:50.400
He's

02:50.400 --> 02:51.870
going back to India to report for duty.

02:51.870 --> 02:53.480
This ship is not for sale.

02:54.030 --> 02:54.560
Okay.

02:54.840 --> 02:55.680
I was just about to ask

02:55.680 --> 02:56.410
about India.

03:08.840 --> 03:09.630
Thank you.

03:09.910 --> 03:10.430
See you.

03:10.800 --> 03:11.680
No problem.

03:15.470 --> 03:17.200
Mr. Zhang from Lu'an Salt Shop.

03:18.400 --> 03:19.120
I'm here.

03:20.030 --> 03:20.840
Excuse me.

03:22.150 --> 03:23.680
Our Master wants to see you.

03:32.590 --> 03:33.240
Mr. Li.

03:33.750 --> 03:34.750
You're here, bro.

03:34.840 --> 03:35.800
Have a seat.

03:41.710 --> 03:42.400
Mr. Li,

03:43.000 --> 03:44.540
I won't lie to your face.

03:44.840 --> 03:45.840
I'll be frank.

03:47.470 --> 03:48.660
This salt field

03:48.760 --> 03:50.800
has been in my family for 3 generations.

03:50.800 --> 03:51.660
I heard

03:51.750 --> 03:53.710
you were buying salt fields in bulk,

03:53.710 --> 03:55.370
so I rushed over with the deed.

03:56.430 --> 03:57.430
It's just that...

03:57.800 --> 03:58.800
if I just sell it

03:58.870 --> 03:59.910
like this,

04:01.520 --> 04:03.250
I'd be betraying my ancestors.

04:05.960 --> 04:07.190
Taking someone's ancestral property

04:07.190 --> 04:08.430
is unforgivable.

04:09.840 --> 04:11.240
This salt field deed
is not that important to me—

04:11.240 --> 04:13.190
I can take it or leave it.

04:14.190 --> 04:15.750
But if I don't buy it,

04:16.040 --> 04:16.680
brother,

04:17.240 --> 04:18.480
can you go back?

04:19.120 --> 04:20.510
If I'm not mistaken,

04:20.560 --> 04:21.600
that outfit

04:21.910 --> 04:23.120
is what you just redeemed

04:23.120 --> 04:24.180
from the pawnshop.

04:26.480 --> 04:27.190
There are

04:27.240 --> 04:29.390
more than 390 salt households in Jiangnan.

04:29.390 --> 04:31.480
Since I'm getting into the salt business,

04:31.480 --> 04:32.800
I must be careful.

04:33.940 --> 04:35.940
Please forgive me if I offended you.

04:37.190 --> 04:38.090
To be honest,

04:39.560 --> 04:42.510
life is indeed a bit hard right now.

04:45.720 --> 04:46.580
How about this?

04:47.430 --> 04:48.680
I'll give you some money

04:48.680 --> 04:49.680
to open a salt shop

04:49.800 --> 04:51.120
so you can make a living.

04:51.120 --> 04:52.360
In name, the shop

04:52.360 --> 04:53.159
will be yours.

04:53.560 --> 04:54.310
Once it turns a profit,

04:54.310 --> 04:56.040
we'll split it eighty–twenty.

04:56.600 --> 04:58.060
I'll supply the goods.

04:58.159 --> 04:59.040
Take

04:59.120 --> 05:00.070
this deed back.

05:09.040 --> 05:09.680
Mr. Li,

05:10.270 --> 05:12.040
you're truly a living Bodhisattva.

05:12.040 --> 05:13.480
You're helping me at a time like this

05:13.480 --> 05:15.340
so that our whole family can live.

05:15.360 --> 05:15.740
I...

05:16.830 --> 05:18.410
I don't know what to say.

05:18.720 --> 05:19.240
You...

05:22.720 --> 05:23.640
Take him down

05:23.720 --> 05:26.180
and hand over the money
and the salt license.

05:27.310 --> 05:27.840
Let's go.

05:46.630 --> 05:47.120
Father.

05:48.600 --> 05:50.860
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

05:54.070 --> 05:56.000
Just a few hours feels long to you?

05:56.190 --> 05:57.650
It's not that I can't wait.

05:58.070 --> 06:00.330
I've been waiting for more than 20 years.

06:01.000 --> 06:02.160
Are you upset?

06:03.270 --> 06:05.040
Then tell me, what have you been waiting

06:05.040 --> 06:06.170
for all these years?

06:08.870 --> 06:10.160
I'm waiting for a chance.

06:10.160 --> 06:11.720
Waiting for your trust.

06:12.480 --> 06:14.280
I've barely been here a few days,

06:14.430 --> 06:15.750
my seat isn't even warm,

06:15.750 --> 06:16.870
and here you are.

06:17.000 --> 06:18.420
When will that old fox Hu

06:18.510 --> 06:19.720
surrender?

06:19.830 --> 06:20.270
Soon.

06:20.430 --> 06:22.030
I followed your arrangement

06:22.070 --> 06:23.390
and gave him 3 days.

06:24.070 --> 06:25.040
Three days?

06:25.510 --> 06:27.110
How do you know it'll be soon?

06:27.120 --> 06:28.360
He's at a dead end.

06:28.510 --> 06:30.070
But I heard him tell the tea merchants

06:30.070 --> 06:31.040
that if they can't hold out,

06:31.040 --> 06:32.470
they can sell the tea to him

06:32.470 --> 06:34.130
and he'll buy it back

06:34.159 --> 06:36.020
according to the previous price.

06:36.720 --> 06:38.590
He was just dreaming.

06:38.720 --> 06:40.720
He's afraid we'll split his power.

06:41.070 --> 06:42.680
He's still reluctant to admit his failure.

06:42.680 --> 06:43.690
This old man

06:44.070 --> 06:45.430
has been in charge of tea in a province

06:45.430 --> 06:46.480
for most of his life.

06:46.480 --> 06:47.240
And you think he's scared?

06:47.240 --> 06:48.600
You naive young man.

06:50.870 --> 06:51.870
He's hoarding tea

06:53.120 --> 06:54.600
to challenge us.

06:54.950 --> 06:56.280
Challenge us with what?

06:56.360 --> 06:58.430
At worst, we don't buy his goods

06:58.830 --> 07:00.160
and let him cry

07:00.190 --> 07:01.190
over that old tea.

07:01.950 --> 07:03.010
Don't pile it here.

07:03.070 --> 07:04.070
How can we get in?

07:05.780 --> 07:09.490
[Tea]

07:13.390 --> 07:14.160
Has Mr. Gu

07:14.180 --> 07:15.180
brought any news?

07:15.390 --> 07:16.140
No.

07:16.480 --> 07:17.600
Is there no room in the warehouse?

07:17.600 --> 07:17.950
Go.

07:18.000 --> 07:18.600
Mr. Hou Er,

07:18.680 --> 07:19.940
the warehouse is full.

07:20.240 --> 07:20.890
Full?

07:21.000 --> 07:21.430
Yes.

07:23.000 --> 07:23.750
Old Master Hu.

07:23.750 --> 07:25.350
Old Master Hu, Old Master Hu.

07:28.390 --> 07:29.120
Waiting like this

07:29.120 --> 07:30.290
isn't going to work.

07:30.510 --> 07:31.430
The nearby tea merchants

07:31.430 --> 07:32.750
all know you have a way,

07:32.920 --> 07:34.070
so they keep

07:34.120 --> 07:35.360
sending tea here.

07:35.720 --> 07:37.040
The money in our counter

07:37.040 --> 07:38.170
flows out like water

07:38.190 --> 07:39.390
and never comes back.

07:39.870 --> 07:41.360
The tea gets older every day.

07:41.360 --> 07:43.640
Spring tea has a daily price.

07:43.870 --> 07:44.920
What do we do if we don't wait?

07:44.920 --> 07:45.390
Well...

07:45.920 --> 07:46.800
Right now, the whole market

07:46.800 --> 07:47.560
follows the same price—

07:47.560 --> 07:48.630
that's set by Li Wantang.

07:48.630 --> 07:50.240
You tell me, do I accept it or not?

07:50.240 --> 07:51.040
Well, why does Li Million

07:51.040 --> 07:52.070
hold a grudge against us?

07:52.070 --> 07:53.800
Don't you know that?

07:54.159 --> 07:55.680
Isn't it because

07:55.750 --> 07:56.720
that Mr. Gu

07:56.750 --> 07:57.720
ruined his plan?

07:58.270 --> 07:59.270
If you ask me,

07:59.600 --> 08:01.360
you should just compromise a little

08:01.360 --> 08:03.160
and beg Li Wantang for some leniency.

08:03.160 --> 08:04.390
The lives
of all the tea merchants in Anhui

08:04.390 --> 08:06.120
are in your hands.

08:07.360 --> 08:08.000
Wait, you...

08:08.000 --> 08:10.130
Old Master Hu, you have an invitation.

08:10.750 --> 08:11.560
Invitation?

08:11.630 --> 08:12.160
I'm busy.

08:12.310 --> 08:13.510
It's a guest from the capital.

08:13.510 --> 08:14.360
From the capital?

08:14.360 --> 08:14.950
Come on.

08:16.140 --> 08:18.430
[Yours Humbly, Li Wantang.]

08:18.270 --> 08:19.070
Old Master Hu.

08:19.950 --> 08:21.950
Li Wantang invited you personally.

08:22.240 --> 08:23.350
This is a way out.

08:23.430 --> 08:24.680
At least it gives you face.

08:24.680 --> 08:25.920
It would be inappropriate

08:25.920 --> 08:27.190
if you don't go.

08:28.390 --> 08:29.040
If I go,

08:29.040 --> 08:30.040
it's for the Tea Merchants' Association.

08:30.040 --> 08:30.720
Of course.

08:34.720 --> 08:35.440
You never said anything

08:35.440 --> 08:36.630
about buying a ship.

08:37.360 --> 08:38.760
See you again, my friend.

08:40.600 --> 08:41.200
When did I ever say

08:41.200 --> 08:42.240
I wanted to buy a ship?

08:42.240 --> 08:43.390
Are you even here to handle

08:43.390 --> 08:44.440
the tea business or not?

08:44.440 --> 08:45.480
Isn't that exactly

08:45.480 --> 08:46.540
what I'm doing now?

08:46.750 --> 08:48.080
Come on, Pingyuan,
focus on the proper work,

08:48.080 --> 08:48.870
will you?

08:49.080 --> 08:51.240
You came here
and just drank some black bitter water.

08:51.240 --> 08:52.300
You didn't like it?

08:52.750 --> 08:54.080
I found it interesting.

08:55.480 --> 08:56.200
I like it.

08:56.840 --> 08:57.600
I like it.

08:58.550 --> 08:59.600
Go back now.

09:00.510 --> 09:01.150
Why?

09:01.240 --> 09:02.870
You didn't get it done,

09:02.910 --> 09:03.510
Pingyuan.

09:03.840 --> 09:05.250
That British guy said

09:05.390 --> 09:06.200
the imperial court

09:06.200 --> 09:07.360
has given the authority to purchase tea

09:07.360 --> 09:08.270
to the Li family.

09:08.270 --> 09:09.360
If they don't buy it from us,

09:09.360 --> 09:10.120
many people in Anhui

09:10.120 --> 09:11.960
will hang themselves
or jump into rivers this year.

09:11.960 --> 09:13.690
How is that considered "done?"

09:15.540 --> 09:16.550
Your logic is getting

09:16.550 --> 09:17.750
clearer and clearer.

09:17.840 --> 09:18.300
Not bad.

09:18.550 --> 09:18.790
Pingyuan,

09:18.790 --> 09:20.270
stop teasing me.

09:20.270 --> 09:20.910
Just tell me—

09:20.910 --> 09:22.790
do we have a solution or not?

09:25.080 --> 09:26.080
Here's what we do.

09:26.510 --> 09:28.170
Rent a fast boat immediately.

09:28.360 --> 09:29.360
You must go back

09:29.390 --> 09:30.650
before dawn tomorrow.

09:32.550 --> 09:33.280
Impossible.

09:33.320 --> 09:35.080
Even if I could do magic,
I couldn't make it.

09:35.080 --> 09:35.790
Didn't you hear

09:35.790 --> 09:36.960
that foreigner just now?

09:36.960 --> 09:37.600
Li Million has to deliver

09:37.600 --> 09:38.860
within 3 days.

09:39.270 --> 09:40.750
He's not in Beijing right now.

09:40.750 --> 09:41.830
My only worry is

09:41.870 --> 09:42.630
Old Master Hu

09:42.670 --> 09:43.440
getting soft

09:43.510 --> 09:44.530
and selling the tea.

09:44.530 --> 09:45.790
If that happens,

09:45.910 --> 09:46.910
there will be no place for us

09:46.910 --> 09:48.030
in Anhui.

09:48.270 --> 09:48.960
When you get back,

09:48.960 --> 09:50.090
tell Old Master Hu

09:50.120 --> 09:51.360
to give me one more day and night.

09:51.360 --> 09:52.000
I will definitely

09:52.000 --> 09:53.200
get this done for him.

09:54.440 --> 09:55.200
One day...

09:55.600 --> 09:56.150
and one night?

09:56.150 --> 09:57.750
Tell him exactly what I said.

09:59.750 --> 10:01.480
Well... so where are you going?

10:01.600 --> 10:02.970
I have my things to do.

10:03.530 --> 10:05.390
Those foreigners can scheme against us,

10:05.390 --> 10:07.150
and we can scheme against them too.

10:07.150 --> 10:08.750
Before, our disadvantage

10:08.770 --> 10:09.960
was that we knew too little

10:09.960 --> 10:10.620
about them.

10:11.240 --> 10:12.240
Just wait and see.

10:12.550 --> 10:14.200
Once this is over,

10:14.270 --> 10:16.470
we'll have plenty of big business to do.

10:18.000 --> 10:18.600
Pingyuan,

10:19.270 --> 10:21.090
can you just give me a hint?

10:21.480 --> 10:22.030
No.

10:24.000 --> 10:25.200
It's not the time yet.

10:26.030 --> 10:26.760
Don't worry.

10:27.360 --> 10:29.290
You'll understand when it's done.

10:29.480 --> 10:30.480
So what if Li Million

10:30.480 --> 10:31.240
is strong?

10:31.320 --> 10:32.080
Since he wants to

10:32.080 --> 10:33.410
drive me into a dead end,

10:34.750 --> 10:35.750
he can't blame me.

10:36.870 --> 10:37.790
I told you to keep an eye

10:37.790 --> 10:39.120
on that Gu.

10:39.910 --> 10:41.050
Where is he now?

10:43.790 --> 10:44.840
I-I don't know.

10:45.140 --> 10:45.870
I'm not sure.

10:50.520 --> 10:51.120
Master,

10:52.080 --> 10:52.940
he left it to us.

10:53.120 --> 10:53.790
So soon?

10:55.440 --> 10:56.360
He agreed to leave the deed here

10:55.720 --> 10:57.070
[Official Certificate]

10:56.360 --> 10:57.220
as collateral.

10:57.360 --> 10:58.030
This family

10:58.120 --> 10:59.150
smokes opium every day.

10:59.150 --> 11:01.080
I don't think the deed
will last more than 3 days.

11:01.080 --> 11:02.530
They're suffering
but still want to save face—

11:02.530 --> 11:03.480
what's the point?

11:02.740 --> 11:05.980
[Official Certificate]

11:04.240 --> 11:05.120
Do I

11:05.150 --> 11:06.440
have a dinner with Old Master Hu

11:06.440 --> 11:07.320
tonight?

11:09.870 --> 11:10.840
Yes, Master.

11:11.360 --> 11:13.080
Go tell the people outside

11:14.000 --> 11:15.050
to head home

11:15.080 --> 11:16.410
and come back tomorrow.

11:17.870 --> 11:18.510
Wait!

11:19.870 --> 11:20.390
Father,

11:21.000 --> 11:21.840
you promised

11:21.860 --> 11:23.460
to let me handle things here.

11:23.750 --> 11:24.840
I just came here today, and you're now

11:24.840 --> 11:26.300
stirring things up again.

11:26.440 --> 11:27.870
If you go to this dinner tonight,

11:27.870 --> 11:29.200
I'll go back to the capital!

11:29.200 --> 11:31.200
I'll just leave everything behind!

11:36.390 --> 11:36.920
Leave us.

11:54.150 --> 11:55.030
Are you angry?

12:16.270 --> 12:18.840
Was it you who suggested Gu Pingyuan

12:19.480 --> 12:21.020
go to Shanghai?

12:21.150 --> 12:22.110
Was it?

12:25.270 --> 12:26.360
He doesn't understand

12:26.360 --> 12:27.240
how the Qing Empire's customs work

12:27.240 --> 12:28.000
at all. What's going on?

12:28.000 --> 12:29.550
He's just a small-time tea farmer,

12:29.550 --> 12:31.500
a prisoner who escaped from exile.

12:32.000 --> 12:33.360
I don't understand,

12:33.510 --> 12:34.870
why do you have to be friends

12:34.870 --> 12:36.030
with him?

12:36.790 --> 12:38.440
You'd rather
ruin your own family's business

12:38.440 --> 12:39.690
to help an outsider!

12:46.840 --> 12:47.360
Father,

12:49.400 --> 12:51.130
you had people eavesdrop on me.

12:55.670 --> 12:56.840
Whether this tea deal

12:56.840 --> 12:58.030
makes or loses money—

12:58.030 --> 12:59.670
I don't care at all.

12:59.750 --> 13:02.280
There are
plenty of business opportunities.

13:03.200 --> 13:04.240
But I have

13:05.480 --> 13:06.550
only one son.

13:09.600 --> 13:10.390
Tell me,

13:11.550 --> 13:12.870
why did you do that?

13:14.600 --> 13:15.270
Why?

13:18.360 --> 13:19.200
I just thought

13:22.600 --> 13:24.530
we couldn't do business like that.

13:25.390 --> 13:27.120
Then how should we do business?

13:28.600 --> 13:31.080
It doesn't have to be a fight
to the death.

13:32.630 --> 13:35.830
The roads of the world
should be open for everyone to walk.

13:36.550 --> 13:38.090
Why do you have to

13:38.120 --> 13:40.180
force others into a corner like that?

13:55.790 --> 13:57.480
I regret it.

13:58.600 --> 14:00.000
I should've let you

14:00.030 --> 14:01.390
keep studying.

14:02.480 --> 14:04.480
You're not cut out for business.

14:08.910 --> 14:11.240
As long as you don't smoke opium
or gamble,

14:11.750 --> 14:12.960
our family fortune

14:13.030 --> 14:14.890
will last you several lifetimes.

14:17.910 --> 14:18.720
Fine.

14:19.750 --> 14:21.010
Go back to the capital.

14:21.600 --> 14:23.730
I'll hire an old Hanlin scholar

14:23.870 --> 14:25.930
to help you pick up your studies again

14:26.870 --> 14:27.840
and teach you

14:29.600 --> 14:30.870
the classics.

14:31.600 --> 14:32.860
That would be good too.

14:34.390 --> 14:34.910
Father,

14:37.870 --> 14:38.630
you want me

14:38.630 --> 14:40.760
to withdraw from the family business?

14:41.510 --> 14:42.080
Yes.

14:44.790 --> 14:46.450
You're not made for business.

14:47.440 --> 14:49.770
And you don't understand the Qing Empire.

14:49.840 --> 14:50.840
I don't!

14:52.270 --> 14:53.080
You do!

14:53.320 --> 14:54.790
You are always right!

14:56.910 --> 14:58.720
I'm the one who suggested Gu Pingyuan

14:58.720 --> 15:00.120
go to Shanghai.

15:00.790 --> 15:01.360
I didn't even

15:01.360 --> 15:03.560
want to come to Anhui in the first place.

15:04.550 --> 15:06.600
You want to buy the goods
from those tea merchants

15:06.600 --> 15:08.170
at 20 percent of its value—

15:08.910 --> 15:10.550
that's bullying!

15:10.840 --> 15:11.790
That's pushing them

15:11.790 --> 15:13.480
to the brink!

15:15.360 --> 15:17.020
What kind of business is this?

15:18.150 --> 15:20.250
If you had troops,

15:20.600 --> 15:23.000
you might as well send soldiers
to rob them!

15:23.320 --> 15:24.720
Wouldn't that be easier?

15:24.870 --> 15:26.120
Kid, kid,

15:27.750 --> 15:31.810
a kind man can't command troops,
and a righteous man can't manage wealth.

15:32.550 --> 15:34.790
Whose path is really easy?

15:39.870 --> 15:40.800
So you're saying

15:41.870 --> 15:43.750
I can't do business

15:44.360 --> 15:46.720
because I can't be a bad guy?

16:05.960 --> 16:07.200
We're exploiting Anhui this time

16:07.200 --> 16:09.130
because His Highness wanted us to.

16:09.750 --> 16:11.320
He was furious that the Anhui people

16:11.320 --> 16:13.440
ruined his plan
at the Grand Tea Competition.

16:13.440 --> 16:15.660
You think I can afford to show mercy,

16:15.870 --> 16:16.510
let them go,

16:16.510 --> 16:17.910
and offend His Highness?

16:20.480 --> 16:21.440
I can't.

16:23.840 --> 16:26.300
If His Highness fails,
I'll be dragged down.

16:26.480 --> 16:27.800
I can only be Li Million

16:27.960 --> 16:29.720
if he doesn't fail.

16:36.720 --> 16:38.050
This is the Qing Empire.

16:54.060 --> 16:59.780
[Baixiang Restaurant]

17:01.720 --> 17:05.250
[Baixiang Restaurant]

17:01.870 --> 17:03.330
Greetings, Old Master Hu.

17:03.910 --> 17:05.710
I'm Master Li Wantang's butler,

17:05.920 --> 17:06.960
Zhang Guangfa.

17:07.589 --> 17:09.000
Nice to meet you.

17:09.589 --> 17:10.829
Is Mr. Li here?

17:11.640 --> 17:12.849
I'm late.

17:12.920 --> 17:14.200
I'm terribly sorry.

17:14.829 --> 17:15.680
Our master

17:15.750 --> 17:17.349
told me to give you a message.

17:17.349 --> 17:17.880
He

17:18.109 --> 17:19.369
won't be coming today.

17:23.480 --> 17:24.790
He's Li Million, after all.

17:24.790 --> 17:26.190
Of course he's very busy.

17:26.589 --> 17:29.350
Please ask Mr. Li

17:29.590 --> 17:31.000
when he'll be free.

17:31.160 --> 17:32.310
I'll visit him then.

17:32.880 --> 17:34.080
I brought some gifts.

17:34.110 --> 17:34.960
I don't know...

17:34.960 --> 17:37.090
Our master wouldn't dare accept them.

17:37.400 --> 17:39.000
One shouldn't take rewards
without earning them.

17:39.000 --> 17:40.160
Our young master

17:40.310 --> 17:41.510
didn't handle the tea matter well.

17:41.510 --> 17:42.720
The foreigners pressed the price

17:42.720 --> 17:43.550
too low.

17:44.440 --> 17:45.000
Yes.

17:45.030 --> 17:46.430
Our master said the quota

17:46.440 --> 17:48.880
for this year's spring tea
is already enough.

17:48.880 --> 17:50.480
There's no need to offend our peers.

17:50.480 --> 17:51.440
That's right.

17:51.920 --> 17:53.120
Keep it for yourself.

17:53.440 --> 17:54.570
We don't need it now.

17:56.240 --> 17:56.920
Sir.

17:57.000 --> 17:57.720
Sir, please wait.

17:57.040 --> 18:00.930
[Baixiang Restaurant]

17:57.830 --> 17:58.830
Sir, please wait.

18:03.510 --> 18:04.240
Sir,

18:05.110 --> 18:06.880
that's not how it works.

18:06.710 --> 18:12.180
[Baixiang Restaurant]

18:09.310 --> 18:12.110
The price is just too low.

18:12.830 --> 18:15.030
He can't force us to death, can he?

18:17.400 --> 18:18.590
How about this?

18:19.200 --> 18:19.920
Please

18:20.070 --> 18:21.160
help us ask Mr. Li.

18:21.640 --> 18:22.770
As long as he gives us

18:23.070 --> 18:24.830
at least a little for our hard work,

18:24.830 --> 18:25.960
we'll treat the rest

18:27.200 --> 18:28.830
as doing it for free.

18:29.510 --> 18:31.310
Consider it an apology to Master Li

18:31.310 --> 18:32.620
on behalf of Mr. Gu.

18:32.880 --> 18:33.610
How about it?

18:33.750 --> 18:35.150
Do you have the final say?

18:35.350 --> 18:36.320
Of course.

18:36.590 --> 18:37.240
It's settled then.

18:37.240 --> 18:37.720
Okay.

18:37.790 --> 18:38.720
Tomorrow morning,

18:38.720 --> 18:39.980
you can go to Tianfu Inn

18:40.550 --> 18:41.680
with the goods list.

18:41.720 --> 18:42.200
Okay.

18:42.270 --> 18:45.170
It's better to resolve grudges
than keep them.

18:45.270 --> 18:46.030
So how about my...

18:46.030 --> 18:46.590
Alright.

18:52.130 --> 18:53.990
[Official Certificate]

19:00.550 --> 19:01.680
It's fine. Go ahead.

19:03.440 --> 19:03.920
Master,

19:04.310 --> 19:05.830
your not showing up scared him badly.

19:05.830 --> 19:07.030
He kept begging for leniency.

19:07.030 --> 19:07.790
In the end, he said

19:07.790 --> 19:09.650
Young Master's price was too low,

19:09.750 --> 19:10.750
forcing the tea merchants
across the province

19:10.750 --> 19:11.550
to a dead end.

19:11.750 --> 19:13.440
He said they just didn't want
their hard work to go to waste.

19:13.440 --> 19:14.270
I told him to bring the goods list

19:14.270 --> 19:15.400
to the inn tomorrow morning

19:15.400 --> 19:16.270
to see you.

19:16.850 --> 19:18.150
They have no way out?

19:18.480 --> 19:18.920
Yes.

19:19.070 --> 19:20.270
There's something more funny.

19:20.270 --> 19:21.730
When I was leaving, he said

19:21.880 --> 19:24.310
you can just consider
their work this year for free

19:24.310 --> 19:25.530
as their apology to you
on behalf of Mr. Gu.

19:25.530 --> 19:26.530
[Official Certificate]

19:27.480 --> 19:28.980
Who knows what that Gu put

19:29.400 --> 19:30.670
in his head?

19:30.920 --> 19:33.780
Apologizing for him
with an entire province's tea?

19:47.590 --> 19:48.200
Alright.

19:51.310 --> 19:52.680
Your young master wants to bet with me.

19:52.680 --> 19:53.510
Do you know?

19:54.400 --> 19:56.480
He thinks I don't know how to do business.

19:56.480 --> 19:57.610
At least I'm not as good

19:57.610 --> 19:59.170
as his friend Gu.

20:01.200 --> 20:03.170
That's childish talk.

20:03.270 --> 20:04.350
I'm not a child.

20:06.510 --> 20:08.400
Are you going back to the capital with me,

20:08.400 --> 20:09.800
or do you want to go first?

20:11.640 --> 20:12.830
I'll go with you.

20:16.160 --> 20:17.760
I know what you're thinking.

20:17.960 --> 20:19.360
I will fulfill your wish.

20:26.590 --> 20:28.240
Hey-oh, hey-oh!

20:28.680 --> 20:30.400
Row it!

20:30.480 --> 20:32.470
Hey-oh, hey-oh!

20:32.590 --> 20:34.640
Row it!

20:35.720 --> 20:37.350
Dragon Boat!

20:37.400 --> 20:39.180
Fly onward!

20:39.310 --> 20:40.880
Dragon Boat!

20:40.960 --> 20:42.200
Fly onward!

20:42.200 --> 20:43.030
Guys!

20:44.270 --> 20:45.110
Guys!

20:46.160 --> 20:47.760
You're the boss here, right?

20:48.920 --> 20:50.830
I want to discuss something with you.

20:50.830 --> 20:52.510
Can you give me a ride?

20:53.590 --> 20:54.550
Sit, sit.

20:54.590 --> 20:55.070
Wait...

20:55.880 --> 20:56.480
Sit down.

20:56.830 --> 20:58.030
Master spent a fortune

20:58.030 --> 20:59.160
to secure the exclusive rights
to tea trade

20:59.160 --> 21:00.550
from His Highness.

21:00.680 --> 21:02.110
The Grand Tea Competition
was just an event

21:02.110 --> 21:03.590
to give His Highness face.

21:03.960 --> 21:05.070
"Top Tea Under Heaven" was supposed

21:05.070 --> 21:06.160
to be granted to the Li family,

21:06.160 --> 21:06.920
and then it would be natural

21:06.920 --> 21:08.200
for the Master to gain the right

21:08.200 --> 21:09.240
to trade with foreigners.

21:09.240 --> 21:10.110
Who knew that Gu

21:10.160 --> 21:11.490
would ruin everything?

21:11.550 --> 21:12.480
If we don't teach the Anhui people

21:12.480 --> 21:13.680
a hard lesson,

21:13.990 --> 21:16.050
not only will the Li family lose face,

21:16.230 --> 21:17.160
we won't be able to explain ourselves

21:17.160 --> 21:18.090
to His Highness.

21:18.510 --> 21:20.640
So you were sent ahead to shake them up.

21:20.720 --> 21:22.680
Master agreed to invite him to dinner,

21:22.680 --> 21:23.310
but he

21:23.790 --> 21:25.510
never planned to attend.

21:31.350 --> 21:32.880
He never planned to attend?

21:34.830 --> 21:35.720
Of course.

21:36.160 --> 21:37.440
He first raised

21:37.510 --> 21:38.590
his hopes high,

21:38.920 --> 21:40.680
then threw him straight into despair.

21:40.680 --> 21:41.880
Once he panics,

21:42.070 --> 21:43.920
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association

21:43.920 --> 21:45.720
will be in our hands.

21:46.750 --> 21:48.880
That so‑called "Top Tea Under Heaven"

21:49.160 --> 21:50.160
is merchandise
exclusively controlled and sold

21:50.160 --> 21:51.550
by the Li family anyway.

22:03.440 --> 22:04.550
We're a dragon boat team,

22:04.550 --> 22:05.750
not a passenger boat crew.

22:05.750 --> 22:06.400
Go.

22:06.920 --> 22:08.160
We're preparing for a race.

22:08.160 --> 22:08.750
Go!

22:11.240 --> 22:12.370
You misunderstood.

22:13.680 --> 22:14.640
Honestly,

22:15.000 --> 22:16.550
I do have something urgent to do.

22:16.550 --> 22:17.510
I must be there

22:17.590 --> 22:18.850
before dawn tomorrow.

22:21.030 --> 22:21.970
By dragon boat?

22:22.270 --> 22:22.880
Really?

22:23.400 --> 22:24.110
It's all yours.

22:24.110 --> 22:25.170
Take it or leave it.

22:30.160 --> 22:30.980
500 taels—

22:31.290 --> 22:32.610
for a trip to Anhui!

22:33.070 --> 22:34.020
Brothers,

22:34.240 --> 22:35.000
this is enough for us

22:35.000 --> 22:35.830
to get wives!

22:36.030 --> 22:36.750
Are we doing it or not?

22:36.750 --> 22:37.680
Yes!

22:38.880 --> 22:39.720
You beat the drum

22:39.720 --> 22:40.700
and cheer us on.

22:40.960 --> 22:41.720
Me?

22:50.590 --> 22:51.160
Let's go.

22:51.440 --> 22:52.400
Beat the drum!

23:59.030 --> 23:59.830
Young Master,

24:00.480 --> 24:01.610
go back and rest.

24:03.000 --> 24:04.400
I just want to see

24:05.030 --> 24:06.270
how Old Master Hu

24:06.310 --> 24:08.000
will surrender tomorrow.

24:08.960 --> 24:10.690
Why put yourself through this?

24:11.640 --> 24:13.220
Has Master

24:13.550 --> 24:15.270
ever miscalculated in business?

24:15.270 --> 24:16.820
With all his moves,

24:17.110 --> 24:18.770
how could that Hu be his match?

24:21.320 --> 24:27.990
[Maojian from Mount Huangshan]
[Taiping Hou Kui]

24:24.830 --> 24:26.430
Just wait for the final news.

24:27.070 --> 24:28.260
Mr. Gu said 3 days.

24:28.050 --> 24:34.520
[Tea]

24:28.550 --> 24:29.550
It's been 5 days.

24:29.590 --> 24:30.160
And we are still waiting?

24:30.160 --> 24:30.590
Indeed.

24:30.590 --> 24:31.640
How long are we supposed to wait?

24:31.640 --> 24:32.960
I told you from the start—

24:32.960 --> 24:34.640
Orchid Snow tea is a monster

24:34.720 --> 24:36.030
and shouldn't have been brought
to the capital.

24:36.030 --> 24:36.590
And what happened?

24:36.590 --> 24:37.880
He went on his own

24:38.240 --> 24:39.770
and stirred everything up.

24:39.880 --> 24:40.880
And the result?

24:41.160 --> 24:42.090
What happened?

24:42.200 --> 24:43.400
All the tea merchants in the province

24:43.400 --> 24:44.920
are apologizing on his behalf.

24:44.920 --> 24:46.680
What kind of nonsense is that?

24:47.110 --> 24:48.720
Sun Wukong was very capable,

24:48.750 --> 24:50.030
but when he ruined the Peach Banquet,

24:50.030 --> 24:51.030
he still got trapped

24:51.030 --> 24:52.760
under Five Elements Mountain.

24:53.000 --> 24:54.720
Sun Wukong at least had a cudgel.

24:54.720 --> 24:55.440
That Gu

24:55.640 --> 24:56.310
only has his mouth.

24:56.310 --> 24:57.270
That's right.

24:57.350 --> 24:58.670
What kind of situation is this?

24:58.670 --> 25:01.680
Then why don't you come up with an idea?

25:02.310 --> 25:04.670
What good is all this useless talk?

25:04.790 --> 25:05.310
When he won the title

25:05.310 --> 25:06.590
of "Top Tea Under Heaven,"

25:06.590 --> 25:07.550
you all rushed

25:07.550 --> 25:09.400
to ask for his recipe and tea seeds.

25:09.400 --> 25:11.840
Why are you all just talking now?

25:15.440 --> 25:16.110
Mr. Hu,

25:16.550 --> 25:18.220
spring tea waits for no one.

25:18.280 --> 25:19.680
Let's not talk about

25:19.790 --> 25:20.880
what Gu is like for now.

25:20.880 --> 25:22.430
We need to get through

25:22.550 --> 25:23.610
this crisis first.

25:23.920 --> 25:24.900
Otherwise,

25:25.030 --> 25:27.030
everyone will be doomed.

25:27.110 --> 25:27.830
That's right.

25:27.830 --> 25:28.750
Everyone will be doomed.

25:28.750 --> 25:29.680
All of us.

25:31.030 --> 25:32.830
If any of you think

25:32.920 --> 25:33.750
you're capable

25:33.750 --> 25:35.240
of getting us through this crisis,

25:35.240 --> 25:37.370
I'll kneel and step down immediately.

25:37.830 --> 25:39.960
If you have no ideas, then just shut up.

25:40.400 --> 25:41.070
What?

25:41.270 --> 25:43.110
Li Wantang is using official power
to pressure us.

25:43.110 --> 25:44.580
Even if we hand over

25:44.680 --> 25:45.480
Mr. Gu's head,

25:45.680 --> 25:46.900
will he stop?

25:47.030 --> 25:48.110
Who got us the plaque

25:48.110 --> 25:49.510
of "Top Tea Under Heaven?"

25:49.510 --> 25:51.910
Who works their butt off
every day outside?

25:52.400 --> 25:54.530
I'm honestly embarrassed for you all.

25:54.550 --> 25:55.400
Shame on you.

25:55.550 --> 25:56.890
You seriously think

25:57.200 --> 25:58.700
Master will lose?

25:59.680 --> 26:01.000
When I first arrived,

26:01.030 --> 26:01.810
I said

26:02.160 --> 26:03.480
the tea business in Anhui

26:03.480 --> 26:04.920
shouldn't be handled this way.

26:04.920 --> 26:05.960
If we want to run
the "Top Tea Under Heaven" brand,

26:05.960 --> 26:07.640
we could negotiate with them.

26:08.200 --> 26:09.680
Why bully them

26:09.750 --> 26:10.830
so arrogantly?

26:11.440 --> 26:13.240
Who does business like that?

26:15.270 --> 26:16.580
At first, I thought

26:16.640 --> 26:18.270
Master was just venting his anger.

26:18.270 --> 26:19.640
Now that I think about it,

26:19.640 --> 26:21.200
what he said makes sense.

26:22.310 --> 26:23.370
As the saying goes,

26:23.590 --> 26:25.270
"No merchant is without cunning."

26:25.270 --> 26:26.680
It's a bit harsh,

26:27.030 --> 26:28.400
but it's right.

26:50.640 --> 26:51.580
You're Pingwen?

26:51.790 --> 26:53.050
Where is your brother?

26:55.240 --> 26:56.500
Did he leave a message?

26:58.720 --> 26:59.680
What did he say?

26:59.960 --> 27:00.820
What did he say?

27:06.480 --> 27:07.240
Servants!

27:07.790 --> 27:08.880
Take him inside.

27:09.550 --> 27:11.150
Make them some hot porridge.

27:17.400 --> 27:18.200
Old Master Hu,

27:18.310 --> 27:19.150
let's go.

27:20.000 --> 27:21.960
Even if you want to die,
wait a little longer.

27:21.960 --> 27:23.290
What are we waiting for?

27:23.440 --> 27:24.270
Look at him—

27:24.310 --> 27:25.070
what can he even say?

27:25.070 --> 27:25.930
I remember now.

27:28.720 --> 27:29.780
My brother said...

27:30.550 --> 27:31.680
What did he say?

27:32.790 --> 27:35.450
He said to wait for him
for one more day and night.

27:35.720 --> 27:36.680
Is there ever an end?

27:36.680 --> 27:37.540
Get him inside!

28:29.830 --> 28:31.070
He really dares?

28:33.070 --> 28:34.310
He really dares.

28:37.350 --> 28:38.010
Is it funny?

28:38.240 --> 28:38.880
No.

28:42.200 --> 28:44.130
Have you sent people to ask around?

28:44.550 --> 28:45.720
Is he afraid to come,

28:45.960 --> 28:46.900
or

28:47.640 --> 28:49.500
is someone among them against it?

28:50.680 --> 28:51.810
No one's against it.

28:52.000 --> 28:53.520
It's just that old guy Hu

28:53.550 --> 28:54.790
holding out on his own.

28:54.790 --> 28:56.000
Master, please don't be angry.

28:56.000 --> 28:57.590
I don't think he can hold out much longer.

28:57.590 --> 28:58.350
It's not like

28:58.350 --> 28:59.810
he can turn things around.

29:00.070 --> 29:01.350
I can't believe it.

29:01.880 --> 29:03.290
By logic,

29:03.680 --> 29:05.310
he should've been cornered.

29:05.920 --> 29:06.960
So how did he stand his ground

29:06.960 --> 29:08.160
after just one night?

29:09.110 --> 29:10.110
Something's off.

29:11.480 --> 29:12.480
Something's off.

29:13.510 --> 29:14.580
Nothing's off.

29:14.750 --> 29:16.110
If he wants to drag it out, let him.

29:16.110 --> 29:17.570
We can outlast him anyway.

29:22.830 --> 29:23.880
It must be

29:23.920 --> 29:25.750
that brat Gu causing trouble.

29:32.640 --> 29:34.200
Send some men to Shanghai

29:34.270 --> 29:35.510
to dig around

29:37.000 --> 29:38.260
and see what he's up to.

29:38.550 --> 29:39.110
Okay.

29:43.590 --> 29:44.110
Father,

29:44.350 --> 29:45.680
I'm going back to sleep.

29:46.160 --> 29:47.720
Our business is not going well.

29:47.720 --> 29:49.110
How dare you go to sleep?

29:51.270 --> 29:52.110
It's your business,

29:52.110 --> 29:53.240
not mine.

29:59.510 --> 30:00.320
Go back.

30:00.350 --> 30:01.590
So many people are waiting for you.

30:01.590 --> 30:02.240
Yes.

30:06.830 --> 30:07.680
Go back.

30:08.720 --> 30:10.520
Old Master Hu, there's a letter!

30:12.790 --> 30:13.590
Old Master Hu.

30:20.670 --> 30:22.080
[To Old Master Hu]

30:26.060 --> 30:27.540
[Cover]

30:27.630 --> 30:28.500
[I caught a chill last night
and was unable to keep our appointment.]

30:28.500 --> 30:29.380
[I feel deeply sorry about it.]

30:29.400 --> 30:30.430
[I have arranged a banquet
at Baixiang Restaurant at noon today,]

30:30.430 --> 30:31.030
[and I sincerely invite you to attend]

30:31.030 --> 30:31.630
[so that I may offer my apologies
in person.]

30:34.310 --> 30:35.240
It's Li Million.

30:36.590 --> 30:37.300
Li Million?

30:37.320 --> 30:37.980
He said that

30:39.270 --> 30:41.130
because he stood me up yesterday,

30:41.350 --> 30:42.810
he wanted to make it up to me

30:43.200 --> 30:44.660
by inviting me to a banquet

30:45.070 --> 30:47.890
at Baixiang Restaurant at noon today.

30:48.680 --> 30:49.830
Go. You should go.

30:49.880 --> 30:50.680
Old Master Hu,

30:51.160 --> 30:53.290
we must accept the face he's giving us.

30:54.440 --> 30:55.100
I should go?

30:55.200 --> 30:56.170
Yes.

30:56.400 --> 30:56.960
You should go.

30:56.960 --> 30:57.750
Hey,

30:58.440 --> 30:59.770
where is the messenger?

30:59.880 --> 31:00.750
Old Master Hu,

31:00.920 --> 31:03.180
he's waiting for your reply downstairs.

31:03.590 --> 31:04.160
Well,

31:04.640 --> 31:05.570
tell him this...

31:07.590 --> 31:08.640
Why did you...

31:08.680 --> 31:09.880
Why did you tear it up?

31:09.920 --> 31:10.720
Why did you tear it up?

31:10.720 --> 31:11.550
Yes.

31:13.640 --> 31:14.440
Yesterday,

31:15.880 --> 31:18.060
if that Li Million

31:18.510 --> 31:21.180
hadn't acted so overbearing,

31:22.350 --> 31:23.530
I would have sold him

31:23.750 --> 31:25.670
all the tea in the province

31:25.720 --> 31:27.350
for cheap.

31:28.310 --> 31:29.270
That was close.

31:32.150 --> 31:33.280
Where are you going?

31:33.400 --> 31:34.110
I

31:34.240 --> 31:35.900
didn't sleep well last night.

31:36.070 --> 31:37.070
I have a headache.

31:38.640 --> 31:39.550
If anyone comes looking for me,

31:39.550 --> 31:41.510
just say I'm unwell
and won't see visitors.

31:41.450 --> 31:47.270
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

31:43.350 --> 31:44.350
After you go back,

31:45.510 --> 31:47.200
tell all your clerks

31:47.640 --> 31:48.480
not to sell

31:49.270 --> 31:51.960
a single ounce of tea today.

32:08.110 --> 32:08.750
Master.

32:10.640 --> 32:11.640
That Hu

32:11.640 --> 32:12.970
is still that stubborn?

32:14.480 --> 32:15.070
Yes.

32:15.920 --> 32:17.640
He hid away
under the pretext of recuperating,

32:17.640 --> 32:18.720
saying he had a headache

32:18.720 --> 32:20.450
and wouldn't see anyone today.

32:21.510 --> 32:23.300
I made a wrong move.

32:26.270 --> 32:27.720
I thought Hu

32:27.750 --> 32:29.480
was just arrogant and foolish,

32:29.640 --> 32:31.480
and I wanted to knock him down a notch

32:31.480 --> 32:32.960
to push the price lower.

32:36.920 --> 32:38.170
If I'd gone

32:38.200 --> 32:39.660
to that dinner last night,

32:40.680 --> 32:42.940
things would probably be settled by now.

32:43.300 --> 32:44.470
Let's wait

32:45.000 --> 32:45.880
and see what miracle

32:45.880 --> 32:47.200
he can pull off.

32:53.070 --> 32:54.400
I've been thinking.

32:56.160 --> 32:58.290
I thought about it the whole afternoon

33:00.310 --> 33:02.170
and still couldn't figure it out.

33:02.920 --> 33:03.480
Master,

33:03.750 --> 33:04.680
we've already

33:04.830 --> 33:06.310
taken care of the foreigners.

33:06.310 --> 33:08.160
And everyone at the imperial court
is on our side.

33:08.160 --> 33:09.690
He has no room to make a move.

33:09.920 --> 33:11.240
What can he even do?

33:12.310 --> 33:13.790
Don't talk too big.

33:17.550 --> 33:19.310
Time has changed.

33:20.960 --> 33:23.620
Now there are foreigners
and the Southern Army.

33:23.720 --> 33:24.880
This world

33:25.480 --> 33:27.080
belongs to young people now.

33:30.960 --> 33:32.290
I'm not going anywhere.

33:33.590 --> 33:35.320
I'll stay right here and watch.

33:35.830 --> 33:36.590
Where is Qin?

33:39.030 --> 33:40.000
He's in his room.

33:43.310 --> 33:44.750
I'm already this old,

33:45.350 --> 33:47.880
and I'm still competing with my own son.

33:50.640 --> 33:51.480
Let it be.

33:53.480 --> 33:55.210
I'm curious about the outcome.

33:56.250 --> 33:58.800
[Jinyang Villa, Shanxi]

33:56.510 --> 33:57.960
How did he make himself like this?

33:57.960 --> 33:59.090
Go get a doctor.

33:59.240 --> 34:00.370
Get the master here.

34:00.390 --> 34:00.920
Also,

34:01.510 --> 34:02.680
get Mr. Li here.

34:02.720 --> 34:03.400
Hurry.

34:27.590 --> 34:28.190
Mr. Gu.

34:29.030 --> 34:30.000
M-Mr. Li.

34:31.070 --> 34:32.280
You didn't have to
put yourself through this

34:32.280 --> 34:33.550
just to drink this wine.

34:33.550 --> 34:34.630
I finally made it.

34:35.230 --> 34:36.120
You're lucky.

34:36.510 --> 34:37.280
In one day

34:37.440 --> 34:38.230
I'll be on my way to Inner Mongolia.

34:38.230 --> 34:39.960
We almost missed each other.

34:42.320 --> 34:42.980
Master Jin,

34:43.080 --> 34:43.679
Madam Jin.

34:43.710 --> 34:44.670
I knew it.

34:44.760 --> 34:45.670
Don't you think

34:45.920 --> 34:46.730
our luck

34:46.760 --> 34:47.920
is getting better and better?

34:47.920 --> 34:48.800
Indeed.

34:49.150 --> 34:49.760
Yes.

34:51.110 --> 34:52.239
Please, take a seat.

34:52.360 --> 34:53.420
Alright, alright.

34:53.440 --> 34:54.480
Wencai told us to take our seats.

34:54.480 --> 34:55.480
This way, please.

34:55.510 --> 34:56.239
Come, Mr. Gu.

34:56.280 --> 34:57.280
This way, please.

34:57.710 --> 34:58.150
Okay.

35:05.800 --> 35:06.440
Mr. Li.

35:10.440 --> 35:11.500
What are you doing?

35:11.630 --> 35:12.230
I've never handled

35:12.230 --> 35:13.630
such a large deal before.

35:13.630 --> 35:15.440
Now the fate
of all the tea merchants in Anhui

35:15.440 --> 35:16.960
rests on me alone.

35:17.710 --> 35:18.440
So, Mr. Li,

35:19.480 --> 35:21.340
I really need your help this time.

35:25.450 --> 35:26.480
Come, sit down.

35:27.590 --> 35:28.260
I

35:28.480 --> 35:29.840
was just about to ask you.

35:29.840 --> 35:30.670
That thing of yours,

35:30.670 --> 35:31.920
the "Top Tea Under Heaven"—

35:31.920 --> 35:32.980
what exactly is it?

35:33.980 --> 35:35.670
I'm in the tea business myself,

35:35.670 --> 35:38.270
yet I didn't even know
what Orchid Snow tea was.

35:38.320 --> 35:39.720
Only after asking around

35:39.760 --> 35:41.160
did I find out it's yours.

35:42.100 --> 35:43.300
As long as you want it,

35:43.480 --> 35:44.360
I can supply as much as you need.

35:44.360 --> 35:44.920
Okay.

35:45.230 --> 35:46.160
It's a deal then.

35:46.710 --> 35:47.400
Now,

35:47.960 --> 35:49.160
let's talk business.

35:49.320 --> 35:50.380
What was it you said

35:50.400 --> 35:52.110
about Anhui tea?

35:52.440 --> 35:53.440
Here's the thing.

35:53.710 --> 35:55.320
Li Wantang got the exclusive rights

35:55.320 --> 35:57.110
to the tea trade between
the imperial court and the foreigners.

35:57.110 --> 35:58.880
He holds a grudge
because I ruined his plan

35:58.880 --> 36:00.150
at the Grand Tea Competition,

36:00.150 --> 36:01.150
and now he's determined

36:01.150 --> 36:02.670
to crush Anhui's tea business.

36:02.670 --> 36:04.230
I can't just sit and wait to die.

36:04.230 --> 36:04.710
I've decided

36:04.710 --> 36:05.840
to fight him.

36:08.570 --> 36:10.030
Li Million in the capital?

36:20.280 --> 36:22.070
He's not so impressive.

36:25.030 --> 36:26.450
Wencai means

36:26.550 --> 36:28.550
Li Million isn't anything special.

36:29.110 --> 36:30.690
That may be,

36:30.840 --> 36:32.360
but this time he got the exclusive rights

36:32.360 --> 36:33.590
to the tea trade

36:33.760 --> 36:35.440
between the imperial court
and the foreigners.

36:35.440 --> 36:36.230
This

36:37.280 --> 36:39.280
can't be solved with just money now.

36:40.710 --> 36:41.480
Mr. Li,

36:42.550 --> 36:44.950
for the sake
of all the tea farmers in Anhui,

36:44.960 --> 36:46.150
please help me.

36:54.400 --> 36:54.960
Okay.

36:55.360 --> 36:55.960
Bro,

36:56.400 --> 36:58.530
I'll take all of Anhui's tea this year.

36:59.030 --> 37:00.070
Worst case, I'll make

37:00.070 --> 37:01.230
a few more trips to Inner Mongolia.

37:01.230 --> 37:02.760
It will be sold eventually.

37:02.760 --> 37:03.360
Right?

37:04.230 --> 37:04.670
Mr. Gu,

37:04.710 --> 37:06.040
I still have to say this—

37:06.070 --> 37:07.440
for something this minor,

37:07.440 --> 37:08.800
you could've sent someone

37:08.800 --> 37:09.400
to tell us.

37:09.590 --> 37:11.330
Or you could've sent us a letter

37:11.360 --> 37:12.760
through any of our shops.

37:12.920 --> 37:15.030
Why did you have to come all the way
in person?

37:15.030 --> 37:16.550
Your health is more important.

37:16.550 --> 37:17.360
Don't end up

37:17.440 --> 37:18.550
getting sick all over,

37:18.550 --> 37:19.710
just like my husband.

37:19.710 --> 37:20.630
Then we really wouldn't be able

37:20.630 --> 37:21.890
to forgive ourselves.

37:21.960 --> 37:22.630
Yes.

37:23.400 --> 37:24.290
I know

37:24.320 --> 37:25.650
you truly care about me.

37:26.030 --> 37:26.770
But I can't

37:26.800 --> 37:27.590
dump every burden on your shoulders

37:27.590 --> 37:28.470
whenever

37:28.670 --> 37:30.190
I encounter something.

37:32.800 --> 37:33.860
As for this matter,

37:33.920 --> 37:35.030
I do have a few ideas

37:35.150 --> 37:36.510
we can discuss together.

37:36.510 --> 37:37.030
Okay.

37:37.710 --> 37:39.910
Although I only spent a day in Shanghai,

37:40.070 --> 37:41.190
I've come to believe

37:41.190 --> 37:42.630
that this so‑called
exclusive tea‑trade right

37:42.630 --> 37:43.920
isn't such a big deal.

37:44.710 --> 37:46.320
The imperial court has no real control

37:46.320 --> 37:48.050
over the foreigners nowadays.

37:48.110 --> 37:48.920
So I was thinking—

37:48.920 --> 37:50.050
could you support me

37:50.440 --> 37:52.500
in making a deal with the foreigners?

37:53.030 --> 37:53.630
Go ahead.

37:54.480 --> 37:55.840
According to my sources,

37:55.840 --> 37:57.480
the British East India Company

37:57.480 --> 37:58.510
is based in India.

37:59.000 --> 37:59.630
If we leave

37:59.630 --> 38:01.300
from Shiliupu Pier,

38:01.630 --> 38:03.630
pass through the Strait of Malacca,

38:03.680 --> 38:05.360
and then travel by sea
for another 2 days and nights,

38:05.360 --> 38:06.510
we can reach India.

38:06.880 --> 38:08.000
Tea sells

38:08.070 --> 38:09.380
extremely well there,

38:09.480 --> 38:11.320
and the price they pay is far higher

38:11.320 --> 38:12.840
than what the foreigners pay here

38:12.840 --> 38:13.880
in our country.

38:14.710 --> 38:15.970
So I've been thinking,

38:16.000 --> 38:17.320
instead of relying on Xianghe Trade House

38:17.320 --> 38:18.920
to deal with the foreigners,

38:18.920 --> 38:20.290
why don't we sell our tea

38:20.320 --> 38:21.440
directly to India?

38:26.740 --> 38:28.510
I'm not dreaming.

38:29.030 --> 38:31.360
I've actually found
a few possible channels.

38:31.360 --> 38:32.360
We're listening.

38:33.880 --> 38:34.840
Before I say it,

38:35.930 --> 38:36.800
could you help me

38:36.800 --> 38:37.710
with one thing?

38:38.840 --> 38:41.010
Anhui tea can't wait even one more day.

38:41.230 --> 38:43.590
Li Wantang has gone mad with greed.

38:43.840 --> 38:45.480
He wants to swallow it in one bite.

38:45.480 --> 38:47.290
Could we find someone

38:47.440 --> 38:49.440
who can take over
all of Anhui's tea at once

38:49.440 --> 38:50.770
and ship it to Shanghai?

38:51.510 --> 38:53.190
Then I'll go to Shanghai with you,

38:53.190 --> 38:53.880
and from there

38:53.880 --> 38:56.340
we can make a trip to India.
What do you think?

38:59.150 --> 38:59.880
Mr. Li,

39:00.190 --> 39:01.360
your draft bank in Hefei

39:01.360 --> 39:02.820
hasn't opened yet, has it?

39:03.320 --> 39:04.250
Are you short

39:04.280 --> 39:05.190
on ready cash?

39:05.550 --> 39:06.350
How about

39:06.510 --> 39:07.510
I invest?

39:08.110 --> 39:09.110
You invest?

39:09.710 --> 39:11.110
There's no need for that.

39:11.710 --> 39:12.960
What I'm thinking is that

39:12.960 --> 39:13.760
we need someone

39:13.760 --> 39:15.020
with enough influence

39:15.190 --> 39:16.360
to take over all the Anhui tea—

39:16.360 --> 39:18.070
someone who can suppress Li Wantang
so thoroughly

39:18.070 --> 39:19.550
that he can only tuck his tail
between his legs

39:19.550 --> 39:21.210
and slink back to the capital.

39:22.150 --> 39:23.670
Only then will our Association Head's face

39:23.670 --> 39:24.400
stay intact.

39:24.840 --> 39:25.880
At a time like this,

39:25.880 --> 39:27.440
saving face doesn't even matter.

39:27.440 --> 39:28.040
No, no, no.

39:28.400 --> 39:29.800
Please wait for a moment.

39:29.920 --> 39:32.650
I'll arrange for someone
to deliver the message.

39:34.550 --> 39:35.110
Mr. Gu,

39:36.320 --> 39:38.070
how about I show you the garden?

39:38.630 --> 39:40.030
Let's go.

39:40.480 --> 39:41.840
He's doing that again—

39:41.840 --> 39:43.700
conducting business in silence.

39:43.960 --> 39:44.840
When you buy your coffin,

39:44.840 --> 39:45.960
let me invest.

39:46.400 --> 39:47.070
Fine.

39:49.320 --> 39:49.760
Mr. Gu,

39:50.440 --> 39:51.640
the water in this lake

39:51.670 --> 39:52.870
is from the Jin River.

39:53.150 --> 39:54.680
A feng shui master once said

39:55.280 --> 39:56.630
that it leads straight
to the Dragon Palace.

39:56.630 --> 39:57.400
Businessmen

39:57.800 --> 39:58.630
like auspicious symbols,

39:58.630 --> 39:59.390
so I named

39:59.510 --> 40:00.280
this place

40:00.440 --> 40:02.150
"Seven Treasures Garden."

40:03.510 --> 40:04.590
"Mountain spirits burn the alchemy stove,"

40:04.590 --> 40:05.880
"the Dragon King offers a treasure boat."

40:05.880 --> 40:07.810
This is a sign of world domination.

40:11.400 --> 40:13.650
Gu, you don't mean it sincerely.

40:16.070 --> 40:17.470
In such an elegant place,

40:17.480 --> 40:18.710
it would be a pity

40:18.880 --> 40:20.480
to talk business.

40:21.070 --> 40:21.880
But now,

40:21.880 --> 40:24.010
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association

40:24.030 --> 40:25.710
is really at a critical point.

40:26.440 --> 40:28.110
If you could lend a hand

40:28.360 --> 40:29.820
and save us from disaster,

40:30.030 --> 40:31.360
wouldn't that kindness

40:31.550 --> 40:32.470
outweigh

40:32.470 --> 40:33.670
even the beauty before us?

40:33.670 --> 40:34.800
I never help anyone.

40:35.760 --> 40:36.550
Never.

40:37.590 --> 40:39.320
You can't show kindness.

40:40.190 --> 40:41.110
When a beggar

40:41.630 --> 40:42.690
calls out "Master,

40:42.710 --> 40:43.510
Madam"

40:43.710 --> 40:45.440
and receives a bowl of leftovers,

40:45.440 --> 40:46.550
it's only because of

40:46.550 --> 40:47.840
those two words.

40:50.070 --> 40:51.200
That's how business

40:51.630 --> 40:52.670
works.

40:53.840 --> 40:54.510
Mr. Gu,

40:54.920 --> 40:55.920
do you understand

40:56.280 --> 40:57.280
what I mean?

40:59.030 --> 40:59.760
Yes.

41:00.760 --> 41:02.590
Nothing in this world comes for free.

41:02.590 --> 41:04.190
If you beg with your face raised,

41:04.190 --> 41:05.360
you'll get nothing.

41:06.190 --> 41:06.880
Yes.

41:07.880 --> 41:10.150
This time,
Li Million got an imperial edict

41:10.150 --> 41:11.680
from a noble in the capital.

41:11.910 --> 41:13.480
With the authority of the imperial court,

41:13.480 --> 41:14.630
he wants to dominate

41:14.760 --> 41:17.070
the tea and medicine market
in the Southeast.

41:17.070 --> 41:18.320
If I act rashly

41:18.670 --> 41:19.800
on my own,

41:21.110 --> 41:22.240
would there be risk?

41:23.110 --> 41:23.760
Besides,

41:24.150 --> 41:25.280
overseas matters

41:25.550 --> 41:26.590
are uncertain.

41:27.150 --> 41:27.880
If I

41:28.320 --> 41:29.710
board an ocean liner

41:29.840 --> 41:30.770
and go out there,

41:31.030 --> 41:33.230
it would be like a human
stepping into a beast's den—

41:33.230 --> 41:34.560
how could I do business?

41:34.880 --> 41:36.480
Of course, for a friend,

41:36.840 --> 41:38.000
it's okay to take a risk,

41:38.000 --> 41:40.060
but it can't be a long-term strategy.

41:41.800 --> 41:43.030
I'm a businessman.

41:43.920 --> 41:45.520
I have no reason to go against

41:45.710 --> 41:47.640
the imperial court and Li Million.

41:47.760 --> 41:49.490
As for which path should I take,

41:50.800 --> 41:52.060
I defer to your advice.

41:54.590 --> 41:56.320
You specialize in the tea trade

41:56.550 --> 41:58.110
and dominate the market in the Northwest.

41:58.110 --> 41:59.510
But if Li Wantang

41:59.590 --> 42:01.160
grabs the entire

42:01.190 --> 42:02.320
Southeast tea monopoly

42:02.320 --> 42:03.740
for himself,

42:03.880 --> 42:05.920
he will inevitably
become a great rival of yours.

42:05.920 --> 42:06.840
That's the first reason

42:06.840 --> 42:07.900
you should help me.

42:08.360 --> 42:10.030
This is a political talk.

42:11.710 --> 42:13.200
Nowadays, business

42:13.320 --> 42:14.710
is no longer like in the past,

42:14.710 --> 42:16.230
when merchants stayed in their lane

42:16.230 --> 42:16.960
and the imperial court

42:16.960 --> 42:18.490
could control everything.

42:19.230 --> 42:20.910
With the rebellion in Jiangnan,

42:20.910 --> 42:22.550
the regime's hold on local affairs

42:22.550 --> 42:23.510
is weakening.

42:24.000 --> 42:25.400
This is a situation unseen

42:25.400 --> 42:26.760
in 300 years.

42:28.210 --> 42:29.740
Yet Li Wantang still thinks

42:29.880 --> 42:31.940
he can use the imperial court's power

42:32.070 --> 42:33.440
to suppress the provinces,

42:33.440 --> 42:35.640
imagining he can dominate everything.

42:36.070 --> 42:37.670
That thinking is outdated.

42:38.670 --> 42:40.070
Since we are in merchants' associations,

42:40.070 --> 42:41.430
we should join hands

42:41.480 --> 42:42.550
and make money together.

42:42.550 --> 42:43.750
If you are willing,

42:43.960 --> 42:45.270
I can offer Anhui tea

42:45.360 --> 42:46.610
at the lowest price

42:46.670 --> 42:48.870
and guarantee you a fixed yearly quota.

42:49.000 --> 42:49.950
We can

42:50.360 --> 42:51.820
expand outward together—

42:53.280 --> 42:54.890
that's the real way to win.

42:55.150 --> 42:57.280
Why bother fighting among ourselves?

42:57.710 --> 42:58.510
Cooperation?

42:59.330 --> 43:00.250
That's good.

43:00.550 --> 43:01.400
Let's join forces

43:01.400 --> 43:02.440
and make money
from the foreigners together—

43:02.440 --> 43:03.070
wouldn't that be better?
